### 查看当前 baseline 配置
GET http://localhost:3000/api/parameters/computerVisionBaselineMat

### 更新完整 baseline（覆盖整份配置）
POST http://localhost:3000/api/parameters
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "key": "computerVisionBaselineMat",
  "value": {
    "Dref_mm": 25,
    "xc0_px": [601.16, 565.88, 637.73],
    "w0_px": [522.66, 495.28, 505.21],
    "s0_mm_per_px": [0.0478, 0.0505, 0.0495],
    "Z0_mm": [200, 200, 200],
    "k_px_per_mm": [],
    "dxSign": [1, 1, 1],
    "camIPList": ["192.168.1.140", "192.168.1.141", "192.168.1.142"],
    "nFramesUsed": [8, 9, 7],
    "timestamp": "2026-01-08 23:02:05",
    "vp_opts": {
      "gray_mode": "rgb2gray",
      "otsu_step": 2,
      "minWidthPx": 20
    }
  }
}

### 仅更新 baseline 的某一字段（如相机 IP 列表）
POST http://localhost:3000/api/parameters/nested
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "key": "computerVisionBaselineMat",
  "path": "camIPList",
  "value": ["192.168.1.140", "192.168.1.141", "192.168.1.142"]
}

### 查看所有参数
GET http://localhost:3000/api/parameters